          "#  Terms & Conditions\n\n# Terms and Conditions\n\nThese terms and conditions (\"Agreement\") govern your use of the IDURAR no-code SaaS platform (\"Platform\") provided by IDURAR. By accessing or using the Platform, you agree to be bound by this Agreement.\n\n## 1. Definitions\n\n- \"User\" refers to any individual or entity that accesses or uses the Platform.\n- \"Service\" refers to the features, tools, and functionalities provided by the Company through the Platform.\n\n## 2. Use of Service\n\n2.1 Eligibility: Users must be of legal age and have the authority to enter into this Agreement.\n\n2.2 Account Registration: Users may need to create an account to access and use the Platform. Users agree to provide accurate and complete information during registration and keep their account credentials secure. The Company reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.\n\n2.3 License: Subject to compliance with this Agreement, the Company grants Users a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, and revocable license to access and use the Platform for their internal business purposes.\n\n2.4 Prohibited Activities: Users shall not engage in any activity that violates applicable laws, infringes on intellectual property rights, or disrupts the functionality of the Platform. Prohibited activities include but are not limited to:\n\n- Reverse engineering, decompiling, or disassembling the Platform.\n- Interfering with or disrupting the Platform or its servers.\n- Uploading or transmitting viruses, malware, or any harmful code.\n- Attempting unauthorized access or circumvention of security measures.\n- Engaging in any activity that could harm or exploit minors.\n\n## 3. Intellectual Property\n\n3.1 Ownership: The Platform, Service, and all associated content, including but not limited to logos, trademarks, software, and documentation, are owned by the Company and protected by intellectual property laws.\n\n3.2 User Content: Users retain ownership of any content they create, upload, or submit to the Platform. By providing such content, Users grant the Company a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, modify, and distribute the content for the purposes of providing the Service.\n\n## 4. Privacy Policy\n\nThe Company's privacy policy governs the collection, use, and disclosure of personal information provided by Users. By using the Platform and Service, Users agree to the terms of the privacy policy.\n\n## 5. Liability\n\n5.1 Disclaimer of Warranty: The Service is provided on an \"as-is\" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. The Company does not guarantee the availability, accuracy, or reliability of the Service.\n\n5.2 Limitation of Liability: The Company shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or in connection with the use or inability to use the Service, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.\n\n## 6. Termination\n\nEither party may terminate this Agreement at any time for any reason. Upon termination, Users must cease all use of the Service, and any provisions of this Agreement that would reasonably be expected to survive termination will continue to apply.\n\n##  Get Early Access Now"
